WEBVTT

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:08.250
Nowadays more and more people choose to live an environmentally friendly lifestyle.
如今，越来越多的人选择过一种环保的生活方式。

00:00:09.050 --> 00:00:15.620
They take public transportation, sort their garbage, carry reusable shopping bags and avoid wasting food.
他们乘坐公共交通，给垃圾分类，携带可重复使用的购物袋，并且避免浪费食物。

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:22.670
Such green habits, once considered unusual, have become part of many people’s daily routines.
这类绿色习惯曾被认为与众不同，如今已成为许多人日常生活的一部分。

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:26.160
Several factors have contributed to this change.
有几个因素促成了这一变化。

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:37.050
First, people have become increasingly aware of environmental problems such as air pollution and climate change, and they realize that every individual’s choices make a difference.
首先，人们越来越意识到空气污染、气候变化等环境问题，并且认识到每个人的选择都会产生影响。

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:46.410
Second, the Chinese government has encouraged green living through policies such as mandatory waste sorting and the promotion of electric vehicles.
其次，中国政府通过强制垃圾分类、推广电动汽车等政策鼓励绿色生活。

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:50.800
Third, a green lifestyle often benefits people themselves.
第三，绿色生活方式往往也让人们自身受益。

00:00:51.600 --> 00:01:01.080
Cycling to work, for instance, not only reduces emissions but also keeps people fit, and saving water and electricity lowers household bills.
比如，骑自行车上班不仅能减少排放，还能让人保持健康；而节约用水用电则能降低家庭开支。

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:05.230
In my opinion, this trend deserves our full support.
在我看来，这一趋势值得我们全力支持。

00:01:06.030 --> 00:01:12.620
Although one person’s efforts may seem small, the combined efforts of millions can greatly improve our environment.
虽然一个人的努力也许显得微不足道，但千百万人的努力汇聚起来，就能极大地改善我们的环境。

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:21.990
Each of us can start with simple actions, such as turning off the lights when leaving a room and saying no to disposable chopsticks and plastic straws.
我们每个人都可以从简单的行动做起，比如离开房间时随手关灯，对一次性筷子和塑料吸管说“不”。

00:01:22.790 --> 00:01:28.410
If we all play our part, our planet will be a cleaner and healthier home for future generations.
只要我们都尽一份力，我们的地球就会成为子孙后代更干净、更健康的家园。
